Package: jv-buster-archive-fix-complete
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sensor Keeper community <killgja@users.noreply.github.com>
Priority: optional
Section: admin
Description: Finish Jetvision's buster-archive-fix 4.0 (patch-rcd-asq-0004) safely
 Jetvision's patch stops with "dpkg database lock is locked" because it runs
 dpkg/apt from inside its own install. This package applies the same changes
 (KSK-2024 trust anchor, archive.debian.org sources, FallbackDNS, DNSOverTLS,
 fixtime.conf paths) and schedules the package repair + apt update/upgrade to
 run 90 seconds AFTER the install has finished. Unofficial; Debian 10 only.
